  "reply": "To update your credit card, go to **Billing > Subscription Settings**, open the **Payment Methods** tab, and click **Add New Card** or **Edit** next to the current card. Enter the new card and billing address, then click **Save Changes**. To review past invoices, navigate to **Billing > Invoice History** and click any invoice number to download the PDF."
